{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7JpkKrt4oDWsjqxihUc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Before I draft this, a few questions. Each answer changes what the pitch says:\n\n1. **What's the crowdfunding target, and what happens if you miss it?** I'm reading the bank's $25,000 as part of the $85,000, which would leave $60,000 to raise from the public. Is that right? Is the deadline June 30, 2027? If you fall short, do backers get refunded like last time?\n\n2. **What are the cinema and the town called, and is there one detail locals will remember?** For example, the year it opened, a well-known feature, or a memory people mention.\n\n3. **Why did the last campaign fall short, and can we say so openly?** Many of your likely backers gave last time and got refunded, so they'll be wondering about it. Naming it head-on (smaller target, bank match, $1 lease, 46 volunteers) is probably your strongest move, but only if you're comfortable with that.\n\n4. **How will the cinema pay its way once it's open?** Donors will ask whether it'll close again. A rough sense of yearly running costs compared with what about 180 tickets a week brings in would help, even if it's only a ballpark.\n\n5. **Are there reward tiers or concrete things a donation buys?** For example, \"$100 names a seat\" or \"$500 covers a month of roof repairs.\" If you haven't set any yet, I'll leave them out.\n\nIf you don't know some of these, just say so. I'll write around the gaps rather than guess."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":249,"cache_read_input_tokens":9519,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":249},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session