{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7Jr4sbzW85U3iGf3VjS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'm holding to all-or-nothing in the draft, and I didn't invent any running costs or other details you didn't give me. It's about 290 words.\n\n<final_document>\n**Bring the Majestic Back**\n\nThe Majestic on Main Street has been dark since 2022. The nearest cinema is now 38 miles away, so a night at the movies means a 76-mile round trip.\n\nWe're the volunteers working to reopen it. We need to raise $60,000 by June 30.\n\n**What your pledge pays for**\n\nReopening will cost $85,000. That buys a new projector and a new sound system and fixes the roof. A local bank has pledged $25,000 if we raise the other $60,000 by June 30. If we do, the building's owner will rent us the Majestic for $1 a year for ten years.\n\n**We've tried before**\n\nThree years ago we asked for $120,000. We raised $47,000, fell short and refunded every dollar. Many of you gave then, and we haven't forgotten that.\n\nThis time is different:\n\n- **The goal is $35,000 lower.**\n- **The bank's pledge covers nearly a third of the cost.**\n- **Rent is $1 a year for ten years.**\n- **46 volunteers have already signed up** to run the box office and the snack bar.\n\n**The town still wants its cinema**\n\nWhen the Majestic closed, it was still selling about 180 tickets a week. People here didn't stop going to the movies. The town lost its cinema.\n\n**All or nothing**\n\nThe campaign runs from May 1 to June 30. If pledges and the bank's $25,000 don't reach the full $85,000, every pledge is returned in full. Your money only goes into the project if we can finish it.\n\nPledge what you can, then tell a neighbor. We need $60,000, and we hope to see you in the seats.\n\nRuth Albers\nChair, on behalf of the Majestic volunteers\n</final_document>\n\n- **Running costs:** Backers will ask whether the cinema can stay open this time. Once you have even a rough yearly running cost, one line comparing it with ticket income from about 180 tickets a week would answer that.\n- **Sign-off:** I didn't know your group's formal name, so I wrote \"the Majestic volunteers.\" Swap in the real name if there is one.\n- **Opening date:** The pitch doesn't say when the Majestic would reopen. If you have a target date, adding it would make the ask more concrete."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1102,"cache_read_input_tokens":9768,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1102},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"67db8ef8-226d-4e9d-96f9-f5593ed9c768","uuid":"22965a25-58e7-4d95-90aa-771aa6878db0","timestamp":"2026-11-16T21:22:12.780Z","request_id":"req_011Ch7Jr4cifSesR7ftXG4eA"}
